; Number words spelled. Cards pass through except 700 + k: for those it asks the host for record k of the numbers
; deck (OUT at ask; ten cards come to INP at gf: the word's letters, -10, then 0s) and sends the letters and -10 on,
; then 2 (all capitals, as in an all-capitals text). The 0s are dropped.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-10: a card: pass it on, or a word to spell
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    SUB   c700
  06                    TAC   pass
  07                    STO   x
  08            ask     OUT   x
  09                    CLA   n9
  10                    STO   i
  11            gf      INP   y        11-26: the record's cards
  12                    CLA   y
  13                    TAC   end
  14                    SUB   00
  15                    TAC   nx
  16                    OUT   y
  17                    JMP   nx
  18            end     OUT   y
  19                    OUT   n2
  20            nx      CLA   i
  21                    SUB   00
  22                    STO   i
  23                    TAC   rec
  24                    JMP   gf
  25            pass    OUT   x
  26                    JMP   rec
  30            x       DATA  0
  31            y       DATA  0
  32            i       DATA  0
  33            c700    DATA  700
  34            n9      DATA  9
  35            n2      DATA  2
